<title>USA: Magnum Hunter names Matthew Lutz chairman.</title>
<headline>Magnum Hunter names Matthew Lutz chairman.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magnum Hunter Resources Inc said Thursday it had named Matthew Lutz chairman of the board and executive vice president of exploration and business development.</p>
<p>Lutz, previously vice chairman, succeeds Lloyd Rochford, who has submitted his resignation as chairman. Rochford will remain a board director, the company said.</p>
<p>Magnum Hunter is an oil and natural gas exploration and development company.</p>
